  message: "PR #1499 (CI green; merged via merge-pr right after this update, which the bare-Closes guard required first): ADR-0004 gains §'Installed dependency source' (off by default, content-detected per ecosystem, disclosed via stderr/sketch/supply_chain_summary.installed_deps_skipped, --trace-deps opt-in + ADR-0045 key in cache key, committed vendored code stays tier 3, build output excluded, I/O-unknown consequence); its implementation note no longer claims symbol extraction is limited to tiers 1-2 (re-verified 2026-10-06: fixture mix.exs + lib/app.ex + deps/foo/lib/foo.ex -> Foo/Foo.greet tier 3 'in deps/', resolved App.hi -> Foo.greet); banner rewritten. ADR-0016 §7 rewritten (trace only when opted in; else untraced, I/O unknown, never clean; unknown_dynamic shape) plus Context sentence. Spec: §14 Motivation + default behaviour + tier-3 path patterns, --exclude default list replaced by the DEFAULT_EXCLUDES/venv-content policy, --trace-deps and installed_deps_skipped marked ⬜ planned, §15 'Extract symbols' row corrected. All marked not-yet-implemented, pointing at WI-bapal and WI-pogar."  # f925
